This project packages draw.io for filex. The release bundle (ui.zip) contains:

1. draw.io (https://github.com/jgraph/drawio), the static web application of
   its release — draw.war, version and sha256 pinned in drawio.lock.json.
   Copyright (c) JGraph Ltd. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0;
   a copy is at the top of the bundle (LICENSE) and in this repository
   (LICENSES/drawio-Apache-2.0.txt).

   Parts of draw.io carry licenses of their own, which ship unchanged inside
   the bundle where draw.io put them:
     templates/LICENSE        Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
     js/libavoid-js/LICENSE   GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1
     img/LICENSE, shapes/LICENSE, stencils/LICENSE
                              JGraph's terms for the icon sets and stencil
                              libraries

   Changes made to draw.io by this project (Apache License 2.0, section 4b):
     - WEB-INF/ and META-INF/ (the Java servlet parts) are left out;
     - two scripts are appended to js/PreConfig.js: the filex interface SDK
       (vendor/filex-app-ui.iife.js) and filex-adapter.js;
     - filex/blank.xml, LICENSE and NOTICE are added.
   No other file of draw.io is changed.

2. @brftech/filex-app-ui (vendor/filex-app-ui.iife.js), the filex interface
   SDK. Copyright (c) 2026 BRF Tech. MIT license.

